; Split-horizon zone for itsm.sogode.com, GLPI's name.
;
; Publicly an A/AAAA to ruby (not a CNAME: the name also carries the MX and
; SPF of its mail domain, hosted on ruby), whose nginx admits only home and
; VPN ranges and proxies them to glpi over wgclient1 - homelab/glpi/ruby.
; Inside the lab it resolves to glpi itself, whose lab-CA certificate
; carries this name, so GLPI knows itself by one URL (url_base) from both
; sides. Only the addresses are overridden: MX and TXT stay public-only,
; and GLPI reaches its mailbox through mail.peetvandesande.com.
;
; sogode.com is DNSSEC-signed, so this needs a matching addNTA() on Delphi
; or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN itsm.sogode.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026111201  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.8.63             ; glpi
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:1000:be24:11ff:fe47:4c50 ; glpi's ULA
